#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "Connector for VozCaster"
msgstr "Connector for VozCaster"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "https://vozcaster.com"
msgstr "https://vozcaster.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid ""
"You talk, VozCaster does the rest: it produces your podcast episodes and "
"publishes them here with PowerPress, from the VozCaster app or Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Tú hablas, del resto se ocupa VozCaster: produce los episodios de tu podcast "
"y los publica aquí con PowerPress, desde la app de VozCaster o desde "
"Telegram."

#. Author of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "Miguel Ángel Terrón Bote"
msgstr "Miguel Ángel Terrón Bote"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "https://potencia.pro"
msgstr "https://potencia.pro"

#: includes/class-access.php:200
msgid ""
"Only the people who manage VozCaster on this site can change who publishes."
msgstr ""
"Solo las personas que gestionan VozCaster en este sitio pueden cambiar quién "
"publica."

#: includes/class-access.php:209
msgid "—"
msgstr "—"

#: includes/class-access.php:210
msgid "Publishes"
msgstr "Publica"

#: includes/class-access.php:211
msgid "With review"
msgstr "Con revisión"

#: includes/class-access.php:217
msgid ""
"Choose, for each role and podcast, whether its users publish directly, send "
"their episodes for review, or cannot use that podcast. Whoever publishes "
"directly in a podcast reviews what is sent to it and can create classes in "
"it. Users connect with their usual WordPress account; their password never "
"goes through VozCaster."
msgstr ""
"Elige, para cada perfil y podcast, si sus usuarios publican directamente, "
"envían sus episodios a revisión o no pueden usar ese podcast. Quien publica "
"directamente en un podcast revisa lo que se le envía y puede crear clases en "
"él. Cada usuario se conecta con su cuenta de WordPress de siempre; su "
"contraseña nunca pasa por VozCaster."

#: includes/class-access.php:226 includes/class-roles.php:181
#: includes/class-settings.php:1123
msgid "Role"
msgstr "Perfil"

#: includes/class-access.php:230
msgid "Manages VozCaster"
msgstr "Gestiona VozCaster"

#: includes/class-access.php:269
msgid ""
"Administrators always publish everywhere. \"Manages VozCaster\" lets a role "
"change this table and the classes of every podcast, without being a "
"WordPress administrator; only administrators can change that column."
msgstr ""
"Los administradores publican siempre en todo. «Gestiona VozCaster» permite a "
"un perfil cambiar esta tabla y las clases de todos los podcasts sin ser "
"administrador de WordPress; esa columna solo la cambian los administradores."

#: includes/class-access.php:270
msgid "Save access settings"
msgstr "Guardar ajustes de acceso"

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:60
msgid ""
"The content of this post was generated automatically with artificial "
"intelligence from the audio transcript. It may contain errors or "
"inaccuracies."
msgstr ""
"El contenido de esta entrada se ha generado automáticamente con inteligencia "
"artificial a partir de la transcripción del audio. Puede contener errores o "
"imprecisiones."

#. translators: 1: link to the VozCaster website, 2: "Try it free" link to the same website.
#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "Published with %1$s: you talk, VozCaster does the rest. %2$s."
msgstr "Publicado con %1$s: tú hablas, del resto se ocupa VozCaster. %2$s."

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:129
msgid "Try it free"
msgstr "Pruébalo gratis"

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:143 includes/class-pairing.php:108
#: includes/class-settings.php:81 includes/class-settings.php:82
msgid "VozCaster"
msgstr "VozCaster"

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:155
msgid "This post was written with AI from the audio of the episode."
msgstr "Esta entrada se ha escrito con IA a partir del audio del episodio."

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:158
msgid "Hide the AI notice on this post"
msgstr "Ocultar el aviso de IA en esta entrada"

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:161
msgid "The AI notice is turned off for the whole site in VozCaster → Episodes."
msgstr ""
"El aviso de IA está desactivado para todo el sitio en VozCaster → Episodios."

#: includes/class-api.php:750
msgid "The title pattern must include {title}, where the episode title goes."
msgstr ""
"El formato del título debe incluir {title} (o {titulo}), donde va el título "
"del episodio."

#: includes/class-api.php:760
msgid "That attachment is not an image."
msgstr "Ese archivo no es una imagen."

#: includes/class-api.php:1030
msgid "You are not allowed to publish in this podcast."
msgstr "No tienes permiso para publicar en este podcast."

#: includes/class-api.php:1047
msgid "The scheduled date must be in the future."
msgstr "La fecha programada tiene que ser futura."

#: includes/class-api.php:1551
msgid "No file received."
msgstr "No se ha recibido ningún archivo."

#. translators: %s: the rejected MIME content type.
#: includes/class-api.php:1588
#, php-format
msgid "File type not allowed: %s"
msgstr "Tipo de archivo no permitido: %s"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:112 includes/class-assistant.php:487
msgid "VozCaster — Assistants"
msgstr "VozCaster — Asistentes"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:113
msgid "Assistants"
msgstr "Asistentes"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:157
msgid "Choose the cover"
msgstr "Elegir la portada"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:158
msgid "Use this image"
msgstr "Usar esta imagen"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:159
msgid "Empty fields are filled in. Review them, change what you like and save."
msgstr ""
"Se han rellenado los campos vacíos. Revísalos, cambia lo que quieras y "
"guarda."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:160
msgid "Nothing to fill in: every field already has a value."
msgstr "Nada que rellenar: todos los campos ya tienen un valor."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:161 includes/class-assistant.php:726
msgid "VozCaster default cover — you can change it any time."
msgstr "Portada por defecto de VozCaster: puedes cambiarla cuando quieras."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:162
msgid "Cover selected from your media library."
msgstr "Portada elegida de tu biblioteca de medios."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:163 includes/class-assistant.php:793
#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:387
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Continuar"

#. translators: %s: site name.
#: includes/class-assistant.php:281
#, php-format
msgid "The %s podcast."
msgstr "El podcast de %s."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:335 includes/class-assistant.php:341
#: includes/class-assistant.php:377 includes/class-assistant.php:395
#: includes/class-distribution.php:246
msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "No tienes permiso para hacer esto."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:350
msgid ""
"PowerPress could not be downloaded from WordPress.org. Try again, or install "
"it from Plugins → Add New."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido descargar PowerPress de WordPress.org. Inténtalo de nuevo o "
"instálalo desde Plugins → Añadir nuevo plugin."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:358
msgid ""
"PowerPress could not be installed from here. Install it from Plugins → Add "
"New and come back."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido instalar PowerPress desde aquí. Instálalo desde Plugins → "
"Añadir nuevo plugin y vuelve."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:366
msgid ""
"PowerPress is installed but could not be activated. Activate it from the "
"Plugins page."
msgstr ""
"PowerPress está instalado, pero no se ha podido activar. Actívalo desde la "
"página de Plugins."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:421
msgid ""
"The VozCaster cover could not be added to your media library. Choose your "
"own cover instead."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido añadir la portada de VozCaster a tu biblioteca de medios. "
"Elige tu propia portada."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:431
msgid "That email address does not look right. Check it and try again."
msgstr ""
"Esa dirección de correo electrónico no parece correcta. Revísala e inténtalo "
"de nuevo."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:432
msgid "Choose the language from the list."
msgstr "Elige el idioma de la lista."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:433
msgid "Choose the category from the list."
msgstr "Elige la categoría de la lista."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:434
msgid "Choose the podcast type from the list."
msgstr "Elige el tipo de podcast de la lista."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:435
msgid "That website address does not look right. It should start with https://"
msgstr "Esa dirección web no parece correcta. Debe empezar por https://"

#. translators: 1: minimum size in pixels, 2: maximum size in pixels.
#: includes/class-assistant.php:438
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The cover must be square, between %1$d and %2$d px. Choose another image."
msgstr ""
"La portada tiene que ser cuadrada, de entre %1$d y %2$d px. Elige otra "
"imagen."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:443
msgid "Your podcast data could not be saved. Please try again."
msgstr "No se han podido guardar los datos de tu podcast. Inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:488
msgid "Short guides that take you by the hand. Pick one."
msgstr "Guías breves que te llevan de la mano. Elige una."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:491 includes/class-assistant.php:521
#: includes/class-pairing.php:401
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Primeros pasos"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:492
msgid ""
"The basics in a few minutes: your podcast data for Apple Podcasts and "
"Spotify, the connection with VozCaster, and your first recording."
msgstr ""
"Lo básico en pocos minutos: los datos de tu podcast para Apple Podcasts y "
"Spotify, la conexión con VozCaster y tu primera grabación."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:495 includes/class-distribution.php:351
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Abrir"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:495
msgid "Continue setup"
msgstr "Continuar la configuración"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:500 includes/class-guided-setup.php:242
msgid "Guided setup"
msgstr "Configuración guiada"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:501
msgid ""
"All the settings, explained one by one: your podcast, titles, writing style, "
"intro and outro, who can publish, groups and reviewers, and the platforms. "
"Skip what you do not need and come back any time."
msgstr ""
"Todos los ajustes, explicados uno a uno: tu podcast, los títulos, el estilo "
"de escritura, la intro y el outro, quién puede publicar, los grupos y "
"revisores, y las plataformas. Sáltate lo que no necesites y vuelve cuando "
"quieras."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:504
msgid "Resume"
msgstr "Reanudar"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:504
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Empezar"

#. translators: 1: current step number, 2: total steps.
#: includes/class-assistant.php:526 includes/class-guided-setup.php:247
#, php-format
msgid "Step %1$d of %2$d"
msgstr "Paso %1$d de %2$d"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:530
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Saltar"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:555
msgid "Welcome to VozCaster"
msgstr "Te damos la bienvenida a VozCaster"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:556
msgid ""
"You talk, VozCaster does the rest: send a voice note and it turns it into a "
"podcast episode published on this site. No rush and nothing to break: we "
"will set up the essentials together."
msgstr ""
"Tú hablas, del resto se ocupa VozCaster: envía una nota de voz y la "
"convierte en un episodio de podcast publicado en este sitio. Sin prisas y "
"sin nada que romper: vamos a configurar lo esencial paso a paso."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:559
msgid "PowerPress is active: it is the plugin that builds your podcast feed."
msgstr "PowerPress está activo: es el plugin que crea el feed de tu podcast."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:560
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Siguiente"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:562
msgid ""
"First we need PowerPress, the free plugin that builds your podcast feed."
msgstr ""
"Primero necesitamos PowerPress, el plugin gratuito que crea el feed de tu "
"podcast."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:568
msgid "Activate PowerPress"
msgstr "Activar PowerPress"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:568
msgid "Install and activate PowerPress"
msgstr "Instalar y activar PowerPress"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:572
msgid ""
"Your account cannot install plugins. Ask the site administrator to install "
"and activate PowerPress, then come back."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta no puede instalar plugins. Pide a quien administra el sitio que "
"instale y active PowerPress, y vuelve."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:592
msgid "The podcast data could not be read."
msgstr "No se han podido leer los datos del podcast."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:620 includes/class-guided-setup.php:36
#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:42 includes/class-guided-setup.php:43
msgid "Your podcast"
msgstr "Tu podcast"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:621
msgid ""
"This is what Apple Podcasts, Spotify and the other apps show about your "
"podcast. You can change all of it later."
msgstr ""
"Esto es lo que Apple Podcasts, Spotify y las demás apps muestran de tu "
"podcast. Puedes cambiarlo todo más adelante."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:625
msgid "Fill in with default data"
msgstr "Rellenar con datos por defecto"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:628
msgid ""
"Fills in only the empty fields, so you can see them and change them. Nothing "
"is saved until you press Save and continue."
msgstr ""
"Rellena solo los campos vacíos, para que puedas verlos y cambiarlos. No se "
"guarda nada hasta que pulses Guardar y continuar."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:642 includes/class-distribution.php:278
#: includes/class-settings.php:1231
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Título"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:646 includes/class-distribution.php:279
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:650 includes/class-distribution.php:282
#: includes/class-settings.php:1232
