#: includes/class-assistant.php:654
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Correo electrónico"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:657
msgid ""
"It appears in your public feed, and Apple uses it to check that the podcast "
"is yours."
msgstr ""
"Aparece en tu feed público y Apple lo usa para comprobar que el podcast es "
"tuyo."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:661
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Idioma"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:664 includes/class-assistant.php:675
msgid "— Choose —"
msgstr "— Elegir —"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:672 includes/class-distribution.php:281
msgid "Apple Podcasts category"
msgstr "Categoría de Apple Podcasts"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:680
msgid ""
"We picked a general category: review it and choose the one that fits your "
"podcast best."
msgstr ""
"Hemos elegido una categoría general: revísala y elige la que mejor encaje "
"con tu podcast."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:684
msgid "Explicit content"
msgstr "Contenido explícito"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:686
msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:688
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Sí"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:693
msgid "Copyright"
msgstr "Copyright"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:696
msgid "Optional. Shown in your feed, for example «© 2026 Your name»."
msgstr "Opcional. Aparece en tu feed, por ejemplo «© 2026 Tu nombre»."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:700
msgid "Podcast type"
msgstr "Tipo de podcast"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:703
msgid "— Not set —"
msgstr "— Sin definir —"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:704
msgid "Episodic: newest episode first (most podcasts)"
msgstr ""
"Episódico: primero el episodio más reciente (la mayoría de los podcasts)"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:705
msgid "Serial: episodes are meant to be heard in order"
msgstr "En serie: los episodios están pensados para escucharse en orden"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:710
msgid "Website address"
msgstr "Dirección del sitio web"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:713
msgid ""
"Optional. The page your feed links to. Leave it empty to use the home page "
"of this site."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. La página a la que enlaza tu feed. Déjalo vacío para usar la "
"página de inicio de este sitio."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:718
msgid "Cover"
msgstr "Portada"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:728
msgid "No cover yet. Square, between 1400 and 3000 px."
msgstr "Todavía no hay portada. Cuadrada, de entre 1400 y 3000 px."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:730
msgid "Your current cover."
msgstr "Tu portada actual."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:734
msgid "Choose from the media library"
msgstr "Elegir de la biblioteca de medios"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:742 includes/class-settings.php:460
#: includes/class-settings.php:1105
msgid "Save and continue"
msgstr "Guardar y continuar"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:743 includes/class-guided-setup.php:389
#: includes/class-settings.php:460
msgid "Keep as is"
msgstr "Dejarlo como está"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:743 includes/class-assistant.php:793
