msgstr "Saltar este paso"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:744 includes/class-assistant.php:796
#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:381 includes/class-guided-setup.php:394
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Volver"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:760 includes/class-auth.php:477
#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:102 includes/class-guided-setup.php:103
#: includes/class-pairing.php:118
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Conectar"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:761
msgid ""
"Link this site with VozCaster so you can send voice notes from your phone. "
"Pick where you prefer to record. It opens in a new tab; come back here when "
"you are done."
msgstr ""
"Enlaza este sitio con VozCaster para enviar notas de voz desde el móvil. "
"Elige dónde prefieres grabar. Se abre en una pestaña nueva; vuelve aquí "
"cuando termines."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:764
msgid "Connected ✓ Your account is linked with VozCaster."
msgstr "Conectado ✓ Tu cuenta está enlazada con VozCaster."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:768
msgid ""
"Your account cannot send episodes to a podcast of this site yet. Ask the "
"site administrator for access."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta todavía no puede enviar episodios a un podcast de este sitio. Pide "
"acceso a quien administra el sitio."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:770 includes/class-pairing.php:208
msgid ""
"The address of this site cannot be passed to the bot automatically. Open the "
"bot, send /conectar and paste this address:"
msgstr ""
"La dirección de este sitio no se puede pasar al bot automáticamente. Abre el "
"bot, envía /conectar y pega esta dirección:"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:772 includes/class-assistant.php:810
#: includes/class-pairing.php:213 includes/class-pairing.php:273
msgid "Open the bot in Telegram"
msgstr "Abrir el bot en Telegram"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:776
msgid "Telegram"
msgstr "Telegram"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:777
msgid "Send voice notes to the VozCaster bot. Press Start and confirm there."
msgstr "Envía notas de voz al bot de VozCaster. Pulsa Iniciar y confirma allí."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:778 includes/class-pairing.php:193
#: includes/class-pairing.php:290
msgid "Connect in Telegram"
msgstr "Conectar en Telegram"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:781
msgid "Web app"
msgstr "App web"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:782
msgid "Record in the browser of your phone or computer, no Telegram needed."
msgstr ""
"Graba desde el navegador del móvil o del ordenador, sin necesidad de "
"Telegram."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:783 includes/class-pairing.php:192
#: includes/class-pairing.php:285
msgid "Connect in the app"
msgstr "Conectar en la app"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:787
msgid ""
"Waiting for the connection… this page updates by itself. Each link works "
"once and expires in 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Esperando la conexión… esta página se actualiza sola. Cada enlace sirve una "
"vez y caduca en 15 minutos."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:806
msgid "Start recording"
msgstr "Empezar a grabar"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:807
msgid "Congratulations, you are all set!"
msgstr "¡Enhorabuena, ya está todo listo!"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:808
msgid ""
"Send your first voice note to the bot, or record it in the app. VozCaster "
"will do the rest."
msgstr ""
"Envía tu primera nota de voz al bot o grábala en la app. VozCaster se "
"ocupará del resto."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:811
msgid "Open the app"
msgstr "Abrir la app"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:818
msgid ""
"To send your podcast to Apple Podcasts, Spotify and the other platforms, you "
"need at least one published episode. Record the first one and come back."
msgstr ""
"Para enviar tu podcast a Apple Podcasts, Spotify y las demás plataformas "
"necesitas al menos un episodio publicado. Graba el primero y vuelve."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:824 includes/class-guided-setup.php:251
msgid "Back to Assistants"
msgstr "Volver a Asistentes"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:840 includes/class-assistant.php:844
#: includes/class-assistant.php:852 includes/class-assistant.php:891
#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:108 includes/class-guided-setup.php:109
msgid "Send to platforms"
msgstr "Enviar a las plataformas"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:842
msgid "Locked until your podcast has its first published episode."
msgstr "Bloqueado hasta que tu podcast tenga su primer episodio publicado."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:845
msgid "Check again"
msgstr "Volver a comprobar"

#: includes/class-assistant.php:849
msgid ""
"Your podcast still uses the VozCaster default cover. It is better to set "
"your own before sending it to the platforms (VozCaster → Assistants → "
"Getting started, step 2)."
msgstr ""
"Tu podcast todavía usa la portada por defecto de VozCaster. Es mejor poner "
"la tuya antes de enviarlo a las plataformas (VozCaster → Asistentes → "
"Primeros pasos, paso 2)."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:851
msgid ""
"Your first episode is out. Send your feed to each platform once; after that "
"they pick up every new episode by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Tu primer episodio ya ha salido. Envía tu feed una vez a cada plataforma; "
"después, cada una recoge sola todos los episodios nuevos."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:889
msgid "Your first episode is out: time to send your podcast to the platforms."
msgstr ""
"Tu primer episodio ya ha salido: es el momento de enviar tu podcast a las "
"plataformas."

#: includes/class-assistant.php:892 includes/class-pairing.php:405
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Descartar"

#: includes/class-auth.php:94
msgid ""
"The VozCaster token can only be used with the VozCaster connector routes."
msgstr "El token de VozCaster solo se puede usar con las rutas del conector de VozCaster."

#: includes/class-auth.php:293
msgid ""
"Invalid parameters. If you use the VozCaster bot or app, try connecting "
"again."
msgstr "Parámetros no válidos. Si usas el bot o la aplicación de VozCaster, vuelve a intentar la conexión."

#: includes/class-auth.php:294
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Error"

#: includes/class-auth.php:324
msgid "Invalid parameters."
msgstr "Parámetros inválidos."

#: includes/class-auth.php:331
msgid "This connection was started by someone else."
msgstr "Esta conexión la inició otra persona."

