msgstr "Seleccionado"

#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:357
msgid "Set up this podcast"
msgstr "Configurar este podcast"

#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:364
msgid ""
"This assistant does not create podcasts or channels: that is done in "
"PowerPress."
msgstr "Este asistente no crea podcasts ni canales: eso se hace en PowerPress."

#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:365
msgid "Open PowerPress"
msgstr "Abrir PowerPress"

#: includes/class-guided-setup.php:391
