#: blocks/index.js:24
msgid "Connect with VozCaster"
msgstr "Conectar con VozCaster"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:161
msgid ""
"You talk, VozCaster does the rest: it cleans your audio, writes the post, "
"makes the cover and publishes the episode on this site. Connect your account "
"once, then record in the VozCaster app or in Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Tú hablas, del resto se ocupa VozCaster: limpia el audio, escribe la "
"entrada, crea la portada y publica el episodio en este sitio. Conecta tu "
"cuenta una vez y graba en la app de VozCaster o en Telegram."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:166
msgid ""
"PowerPress is not active. Install and activate it before connecting, so "
"episodes reach your podcast feed."
