#: includes/class-settings.php:925
msgid "Separator sound"
msgstr "Sonido de corte"

#: includes/class-settings.php:927
msgid ""
"Short sound played between the sections of an episode recorded in several "
"audios (for example, interviews at an event). Without it, sections are "
"joined with a one-second pause."
msgstr ""
"Sonido corto que suena entre las partes de un episodio grabado en varios "
"audios (por ejemplo, entrevistas en un evento). Sin él, las partes se unen "
"con una pausa de un segundo."

#: includes/class-settings.php:938
msgid "Delete the separator sound?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar el sonido de corte?"

#: includes/class-settings.php:943
msgid "To replace the separator sound, upload a new file:"
msgstr "Para reemplazar el sonido de corte, sube un archivo nuevo:"

#: includes/class-settings.php:945
