msgstr "Conectar con VozCaster"

#: blocks/connect/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Lets each logged-in user connect their account to the VozCaster app or "
"Telegram bot."
msgstr ""
"Permite que cada usuario que ha accedido conecte su cuenta a la app o al bot "
"de Telegram de VozCaster."

#: blocks/review/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "VozCaster review"
msgstr "Revisión de VozCaster"

#: blocks/review/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Lists the episodes waiting for the logged-in user's review, to listen to "
"them and publish or return them."
msgstr ""
"Muestra los episodios que esperan la revisión del usuario, para escucharlos "
"y publicarlos o devolverlos."
